## Treasury

Current Treasury Size: Tidak diungkap secara real-time; laporan tahunan EF 2023 menunjukkan aset ~$1,6M (tertulis dalam laporan keuangan Swiss foundation, namun angka ini tidak mencakup seluruh holding on-chain EF yang tidak dipublikasikan detailnya)
Treasury Composition: Campuran ETH, BTC, stablecoin (USDC/DAI), dan fiat (CHF/USD); proporsi pasti tidak dipublikasikan
Stablecoin Holdings: Tidak diungkap rincian jumlah per aset
Native Token Holdings: Tidak diungkap jumlah ETH yang dimiliki EF secara spesifik; blockchain analyst memperkirakan alamat terkait EF memegang >200k ETH (estimasi eksternal, bukan data resmi)
Other Assets: Tidak diungkap
Treasury Custodian: Ethereum Foundation (Stiftung) — entitas hukum Swiss; manajemen aset internal + custodian institusional (detail tidak dipublikasikan)
Sources: https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/ ; https://www.stiftungsregister.ch/de/stiftung/ethereum-stiftung ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/01/23/ef-grants-update-q4-2023

## Revenue Model

Revenue Stream: Protocol Fees (Base Fee Burn - EIP-1559)
Status: Live
Description: Base fee dari setiap transaksi dibakar (burn) secara on-chain; bukan pendapatan yang masuk ke treasury melainkan pengurangan supply ETH; sejak London (Agustus 2021) >3,5M ETH terbakar
Sources: https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559 ; https://ultrasound.money/ ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2021/07/15/london-mainnet-announcement

Revenue Stream: Validator Rewards (Consensus Layer Issuance)
Status: Live
Description: Emisi ETH baru untuk validator (beacon chain rewards); ~0,5%–0,8% inflasi netto per tahun pasca-Merge; dibayar ke validator, bukan ke treasury EF
Sources: https://ethereum.org/en/upgrades/merge/ ; https://beaconcha.in/ ; https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md

Revenue Stream: Priority Tips (EIP-1559 Priority Fee)
Status: Live
Description: Tip/priority fee dibayar ke block proposer (validator); bukan pendapatan protokol atau EF
Sources: https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559 ; https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/gas/

Revenue Stream: MEV (Maximal Extractable Value) — Proposer Revenue via MEV-Boost
Status: Live
Description: Validator menerima payment dari builder via MEV-Boost untuk block space; >90% blok melalui MEV-Boost; pendapatan ke validator individu, bukan protokol
Sources: https://flashbots.net/ ; https://mevboost.pics/ ; https://github.com/flashbots/mev-boost-specs

Revenue Stream: Blob Fees (EIP-4844 Blob Gas Market)
Status: Live (sejak Dencun, Maret 2024)
Description: Blob gas fee dibayar oleh L2 untuk data availability; base fee blob dibakar (burn), tidak masuk treasury
Sources: https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844 ; https://ethereum.org/en/upgrades/dencun/ ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement

Revenue Stream: Ethereum Foundation Treasury Yield / Investment Returns
Status: Live
Description: Return dari pengelolaan aset treasury (staking ETH treasury, yield stablecoin, dll.); detail tidak dipublikasikan
Sources: https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/ ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/01/23/ef-grants-update-q4-2023

Revenue Stream: Enterprise Services (Consensys, Infura, Alchemy, dll.) — Bukan pendapatan protokol Ethereum
Status: Live
Description: Pendapatan entitas komersial terpisah (Consensys, Infura, Alchemy) dari layanan RPC, tooling, L2; bukan revenue protokol Ethereum atau EF
Sources: https://consensys.net/ ; https://www.infura.io/ ; https://www.alchemy.com/

## Revenue History

Tidak diungkap secara agregat untuk protokol Ethereum (base fee burn on-chain terlihat tapi bukan "revenue" akuntansi; validator rewards on-chain; EF financial report hanya mencakup operasional foundation, bukan protokol)
Sources: https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/ ; https://ultrasound.money/ ; https://beaconcha.in/

## Fundraising Mechanism

Mechanism: Public Sale (Ether Crowdsale 2014)
Description: Penjualan ETH langsung ke publik via Bitcoin selama 42 hari; tanpa VC, tanpa private sale terstruktur modern
Sources: https://blog.ethereum.org/2014/07/22/launching-the-ether-sale ; https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile

Mechanism: Foundation Grants (Ecosystem Support Program)
Description: EF mendistribusikan dana dari treasury crowdsale ke pengembang, peneliti, komunitas via program hibah
Sources: https://esp.ethereum.foundation/ ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2022/01/18/ecosystem-support-program-update

Mechanism: Protocol Revenue (Burn & Issuance)
Description: Mekanisme ekonomi protokol (EIP-1559 burn, PoS issuance) mengatur supply ETH; bukan fundraising tradisional
Sources: https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559 ; https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md

Mechanism: Bootstrapping / Community Funding
Description: Pengembangan awal didanai crowdsale; pengembangan lanjutan didanai EF grants + kontribusi korporat (Consensys, Nethermind, Prysmatic Labs, dll.) yang menginvestasikan resource sendiri
Sources: https://blog.ethereum.org/2014/09/02/ether-sale-ends-raised-31500-btc ; https://consensys.net/ ; https://nethermind.io/ ; https://prysmaticlabs.com/

## Token Sale

Private Sale: Tidak ada private sale terpisah sebelum crowdsale; sejumlah alokasi early contributors (12M ETH) dialokasikan ke founding team, EF, dan kontributor awal — bukan penjualan
Public Sale: Ether Crowdsale (2014-07-22 s.d. 2014-09-02)
Status: Completed
Amount Raised: 31.529 BTC (~$18,3 juta pada harga saat itu)
Currency: BTC
Tokens Sold: 60.000.000 ETH (60 juta)
Price: 2000 ETH/BTC (awal hari 1-14), kemudian linear decay ke 1337 ETH/BTC
Sources: https://blog.ethereum.org/2014/07/22/launching-the-ether-sale ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2014/09/02/ether-sale-ends-raised-31500-btc ; https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile

Launchpad: Tidak ada (platform sendiri)
Auction: Tidak ada
Community Sale: Crowdsale bersifat community sale terbuka
Sources: https://blog.ethereum.org/2014/07/22/launching-the-ether-sale

## Financial Dependencies

Dependency: Ethereum Foundation Treasury (Crowdsale Proceeds)
Description: Dana utama pengembangan protokol, riset, grants, operasional EF berasal dari treasury crowdsale 2014 (BTC/ETH) + pengelolaan aset berkelanjutan
Type: Foundation
Sources: https://ethereum.org/en/foundation/ ; https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/ ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2014/09/02/ether-sale-ends-raised-31500-btc

Dependency: Corporate Contributors (Client Teams, Infrastructure Providers)
Description: Consensys (Besu, Teku, Infura, MetaMask), Nethermind, Prysmatic Labs, Sigma Prime, ChainSafe, Erigon/Thorax, Flashbots, Alchemy, dll. menginvestasikan resource engineering sendiri; tidak bergantung dana EF penuh
Type: Revenue (Corporate) / Technical-Integration
Sources: https://consensys.net/ ; https://nethermind.io/ ; https://prysmaticlabs.com/ ; https://sigmaprime.io/ ; https://chainsafe.io/ ; https://erigon.tech/ ; https://flashbots.net/ ; https://www.alchemy.com/

Dependency: Validator Staking Capital
Description: Keamanan jaringan bergantung pada >1 juta validator yang mengunci 32+ ETH masing-masing (~32M+ ETH total staked); capital berasal dari validator individu, staking pool (Lido, Coinbase, Rocket Pool), exchange
Type: Protocol Revenue / Staking Capital
Sources: https://beaconcha.in/ ; https://ethereum.org/en/staking/ ; https://lido.fi/ ; https://rocketpool.net/

Dependency: Grant Programs (EF ESP, Devcon Grants, Community Grants)
Description: Hibah berkelanjutan dari EF ke ekosistem; tidak jaminan permanen
Type: Grant
Sources: https://esp.ethereum.foundation/ ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2022/01/18/ecosystem-support-program-update

## Financial Risk

Risk: Treasury Concentration in Native Asset (ETH)
Description: Mayoritas treasury EF denominasi dalam ETH; volatilitas harga memengaruhi daya beli operasional dan grant; dikonfirmasi dalam laporan keuangan Swiss foundation dan wawancara EF leadership
Source Type: Laporan Resmi / Disclosure
Sources: https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/ ; https://www.stiftungsregister.ch/de/stiftung/ethereum-stiftung ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2022/09/15/the-merge-is-done (Vitalik Buterin statement on treasury management)

Risk: Revenue Decline Risk (Fee Market Volatility)
Description: Base fee burn dan validator rewards bergantung pada aktivitas jaringan; bear market menurunkan fee revenue dan staking yield; tidak ada revenue guaranteed
Source Type: Governance / Protocol Design
Sources: https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559 ; https://ultrasound.money/ ; https://ethereum.org/en/roadmap/scaling/

Risk: Funding Dependency on EF Grants for Core Protocol Research
Description: Riset protokol inti (sharding, verkle trees, PBS, quantum resistance) sangat bergantung pada EF grants; jika treasury EF menipis, riset terganggu; dikonfirmasi dalam EF annual report dan blog
Source Type: Laporan Resmi
Sources: https://ethereum.foundation/annual-report-2023/ ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/01/23/ef-grants-update-q4-2023 ; https://github.com/ethereum/research

Risk: Legal / Regulatory Financial Risk (OFAC Sanctions, Securities Law)
Description: Sanksi OFAC ke Tornado Cash (2022), investigasi SEC terkait status ETH sebagai security (2023-2024), regulasi MiCA EU, potensi klasifikasi staking sebagai security; menciptakan ketidakpastian hukum untuk EF, validator, dan ekosistem
Source Type: Regulator / Disclosure
Sources: https://home.treasury.gov/policy-issues/financial-sanctions/sanctions-programs-and-country-information (OFAC Tornado Cash 2022-08-08) ; https://www.sec.gov/ ; https://www.esma.europa.eu/ (MiCA) ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2023/04/12/shanghai-announcement (EF statement on regulatory engagement)

Risk: Client Development Funding Sustainability
Description: Beberapa client team (Nethermind, Prysmatic Labs, Sigma Prime, ChainSafe, Erigon) bergantung pada venture funding atau revenue layanan enterprise; tidak ada funding protokol terjamin; risiko jika VC funding kering
Source Type: Governance / Disclosure (wawancara publik team leads)
Sources: https://nethermind.io/ ; https://prysmaticlabs.com/ ; https://sigmaprime.io/ ; https://chainsafe.io/ ; https://erigon.tech/ ; https://www.theblock.co/post/2022/alchemy-valuation (contoh funding landscape)

